<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.8 percent.</p>
<p>		   Nov 1, 2003 CCT	 pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.16 pct	 6.25</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.07 pct	 7.19</p>
<p>    Assigned price    100.95	  101.35</p>
<p>    Total bids	  4.644 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note- Comparison is with an auction of a first tranche of the 3.8 percent CCTs on November 15.</p>
</text>
